<title>USA: Fed said to be buying coupons -- market sources.</title>
<headline>Fed said to be buying coupons -- market sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of New York is said to be buying coupons in the U.S. domestic money market, local money market sources said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 859-1676 ))</p>
